#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Insights #260: CLI and TUI Applications — A Terminal Renaissance in Java"
msgstr "Quarkus Insights 第 260 期：CLI 和 TUI 应用程序——Java 领域的终端复兴"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "This summary was generated using AI, reviewed by humans - https://www.youtube.com/live/EXIFCPFB3kQ[watch the video] for the full story."
msgstr "本摘要由人工智能生成，并经人工审核—— link:https://www.youtube.com/live/EXIFCPFB3kQ[请观看视频] 了解完整内容。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The terminal is old — older than most living software — yet it is experiencing one of its most significant periods of investment and interest in decades. In episode 260, Max Andersen and Ståle Pedersen join hosts Eric Deandrea and Holly Cummins to make the case that Java, powered by Quarkus, is now one of the best platforms for building command-line and text-user-interface applications. The reason is not nostalgia; it is AI."
msgstr "终端虽然历史悠久——比大多数现存软件都要古老——但如今却迎来了数十年来投资和关注度最高的一个时期。 在第 260 期节目中，Max Andersen 和 Ståle Pedersen 与主持人 Eric Deandrea 和 Holly Cummins 一起论证：由 Quarkus 驱动的 Java 现已成为构建命令行和文本用户界面应用程序的最佳平台之一。原因并非怀旧，而是人工智能。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus News"
msgstr "Quarkus 新闻"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Max opened with a brief news flash before the main topic: Quarkus 3.40 has been branched and is working its way through the release stages. He also delivered a pointed PSA to any AI agents who may be listening to the transcript: someone submitted 100 pull requests in a single day. The community appreciates the enthusiasm, but unreviewed code cannot ship — not into a codebase running in banks, nuclear power plants, or wherever Quarkus ends up. Small PRs, paced contributions, and human review remain essential. \"Use AI to fight AI,\" Max offered as one possible mitigation, before the team settled on a simpler summary: slow down, make them smaller, and let the humans keep up."
msgstr "在进入正题之前，Max先简要通报了一则快讯：Quarkus 3.40 已创建分支，目前正在经历各个发布阶段。他还向可能正在收听本次会议记录的任何 AI 代理发布了一则直截了当的公告：有人在一天内提交了 100 个拉取请求。 社区虽然欣赏这种热情，但未经审查的代码绝不能发布——无论是运行在银行、核电站，还是Quarkus最终应用的任何地方。 小规模的 PR、循序渐进的贡献以及人工审查依然至关重要。“用 AI 对抗 AI，”Max 提出了一个可能的缓解方案，随后团队达成了一个更简洁的总结：放慢节奏，缩小规模，让人类能够跟上进度。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why Now? The Terminal&#8217;s Second Act"
msgstr "为何是现在？《航站楼》的第二幕"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Max's opening framing cuts through the nostalgia: the terminal is not back because people are sentimental about green-screen displays. It is back because it is the lowest-cost, highest-availability UI that has ever existed. Every cloud VM has one. SSH reaches it from anywhere. It has no pixel budget to render, no browser engine to load, and no networking stack beyond a TCP connection."
msgstr "马克斯开篇的论述一针见血地戳破了这种怀旧情绪：终端之所以卷土重来，并不是因为人们对绿屏显示器怀有眷恋之情。它之所以回归，是因为它是迄今为止成本最低、可用性最高的用户界面。 每台云虚拟机都配备一个。SSH可从任何地方访问它。它无需消耗像素资源进行渲染，无需加载浏览器引擎，除了TCP连接之外也不需要任何网络协议栈。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "For AI agents specifically, the economics are compelling. Text in, text out. No button coordinates to guess, no DOM to parse. Keyboard and output streams are precisely the interface contract that agents can consume reliably. Agents can also call `help` and read the output directly. CLIs written with good tab-completion and structured output become first-class agent tools with minimal adaptation."
msgstr "就人工智能代理而言，其经济效益尤为显著。输入文本，输出文本。 无需猜测按钮坐标，无需解析 DOM。键盘和输出流正是智能代理能够可靠调用的接口契约。智能代理还可以调用 `帮助功能` 并直接读取输出内容。那些具备良好 Tab 键补全功能和结构化输出的命令行界面（CLI），只需极少调整，就能成为智能代理的一流工具。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Beyond agents, the terminal is scriptable, composable, remote-friendly, and — increasingly — genuinely fast. Modern terminal emulators like https://ghostty.org/[Ghostty], https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/[Kitty], and https://github.com/microsoft/terminal[Windows Terminal] are investing heavily in GPU rendering and pixel-perfect image support, closing the visual gap with web UIs faster than most expect."
msgstr "除了代理之外，终端还支持脚本编写、可组合、便于远程操作，而且——速度也越来越快。 link:https://ghostty.org/[Ghostty] 、 link:https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/[Kitty] 和 link:https://github.com/microsoft/terminal[Windows Terminal] 等现代终端模拟器正在大力投入 GPU 渲染和像素级精确的图像支持，其视觉效果与网页界面的差距正在以超出大多数人预期的速度缩小。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Landscape: Terminal, Shell, REPL, CLI, TUI"
msgstr "环境：终端、Shell、REPL、CLI、TUI"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "One of the most useful parts of Max's opening was a clear taxonomy of terms that engineers who live in web and backend services often conflate:"
msgstr "Max 开场白中最实用的一点，是对那些常在 Web 和后端服务领域工作的工程师们往往混为一谈的术语所做的清晰分类："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Terminal** — the window that draws characters. iTerm2, Ghostty, Windows Terminal, Kitty, Warp are all terminals."
msgstr "*终端* ——用于显示字符的窗口。iTerm2、Ghostty、Windows Terminal、Kitty、Warp 都是终端。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Shell** — the first program the terminal launches. Bash, Fish, https://www.nushell.sh/[Nushell], and Zsh are shells. A shell is a specific kind of REPL."
msgstr "*Shell* ——终端启动时运行的第一个程序。Bash、Fish、 link:https://www.nushell.sh/[Nushell] 和 Zsh 都是 shell。Shell 是一种特殊的 REPL。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**REPL** (Read-Evaluate-Print Loop) — any interactive prompt: Python's `>>>`, Node's interactive mode, and shells themselves."
msgstr "*REPL* （读取-评估-打印循环）——任何交互式提示符：Python 的 `>>>` 、Node 的交互模式以及 shell 本身。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**CLI** (Command Line Interface) — a program that takes arguments and exits. `git`, `kubectl`, `curl`, https://www.jbang.dev/[JBang], and `quarkus` are CLIs."
msgstr "*CLI* （命令行界面）——一种接受参数并随后退出的程序。 `git` 、 `kubectl` 、 `curl` 、 link:https://www.jbang.dev/[JBang] 和 `quarkus` 都是 CLI。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**TUI** (Text User Interface) — a full-screen, interactive application rendered in the terminal. `vim`, `htop`, https://k9scli.io/[k9s], and Lazygit are TUIs."
msgstr "*TUI* （文本用户界面）——一种在终端中显示的全屏交互式应用程序。 `vim` 、 `htop` 、 link:https://k9scli.io/[k9s] 和 Lazygit 都是 TUI。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus Dev Mode itself qualifies: it starts a TUI console powered by Aesh, with a persistent command line at the bottom of the screen. Many Quarkus developers have been using TUI technology without knowing it."
msgstr "Quarkus 开发模式本身就符合这一条件：它会启动一个由 Aesh 驱动的 TUI 控制台，屏幕底部会始终显示一条命令行。许多 Quarkus 开发者一直在使用 TUI 技术，却浑然不觉。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Players: Aesh, PicoCLI, and TamboUI"
msgstr "参与者：Aesh、PicoCLI 和 TamboUI"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Max laid out the three libraries central to this episode and how they relate:"
msgstr "马克斯详细介绍了本集的核心三个库，以及它们之间的关联："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://github.com/aeshell/aesh[**Aesh**] — split into two sub-projects: `aesh-readline` (the low-level terminal I/O layer, key handling, line editing) and `aesh` proper (the REPL and CLI command parsing layer). Aesh started as a fork of https://github.com/jline/jline3[JLine] but has diverged significantly. It is already in use inside Quarkus Dev Mode."
msgstr "link:https://github.com/aeshell/aesh[Aesh] — 已拆分为两个子项目： `aesh-readline` （低级终端 I/O 层、键处理、行编辑）和 `aesh` 本身（REPL 和 CLI 命令解析层）。 Aesh 最初是 link:https://github.com/jline/jline3[JLine] 的分支，但现已与之产生显著差异。它目前已在 Quarkus 开发模式中投入使用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://picocli.info/[**PicoCLI**] — the long-standing champion of Java CLI argument parsing. Best-in-class documentation, broad ecosystem adoption, simpler API surface. Still the right choice for CLI-only use cases where startup speed is not the primary concern."
msgstr "link:https://picocli.info/[PicoCLI——] Java CLI 参数解析领域的长期领军者。拥有业界顶尖的文档、广泛的生态系统采用率以及更简洁的 API 接口。对于仅需 CLI 且启动速度并非首要考虑因素的使用场景，它依然是最佳选择。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**TamboUI** — Max's newer project. A full TUI framework for Java: reactive layout, CSS-like styling, image rendering, and an Aesh backend for terminal I/O and command wiring."
msgstr "*TamboUI* —— Max 的最新项目。这是一个面向 Java 的完整 TUI 框架：支持响应式布局、类 CSS 样式、图像渲染，以及用于终端 I/O 和命令连接的 Aesh 后端。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The key shift this year: Aesh has crossed over into PicoCLI's territory on argument parsing quality, while adding capabilities PicoCLI was never designed to provide (interactive REPL, tab completion dynamic enough to round-trip to the application, WebSocket connections, and now TamboUI integration)."
msgstr "今年的关键变化在于：Aesh 在参数解析质量方面已超越 PicoCLI，同时还新增了 PicoCLI 设计之初从未考虑提供的功能（交互式 REPL、动态程度足以与应用程序双向交互的 Tab 补全、WebSocket 连接，以及现已实现的 TamboUI 集成）。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aesh 3.18: The Annotation Processor and Lazy Runtime"
msgstr "Aesh 3.18：注释处理器与懒惰运行时"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The headline performance story for Aesh this year is an annotation processor that eliminates reflection from command startup."
msgstr "Aesh 今年在性能方面的最大亮点是一个注释处理器，它消除了命令启动过程中的反射操作。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Before 3.18, Aesh (and PicoCLI before it) scanned command class structures at startup using reflection — building internal models of every registered command, even those that would never be called in a given invocation. On the JVM this added measurable latency; with https://www.graalvm.org/[GraalVM] native images it was manageable but still visible."
msgstr "在 3.18 版本之前，Aesh（以及之前的 PicoCLI）会在启动时使用反射扫描命令类结构——为每个已注册的命令构建内部模型，即使这些命令在当前调用中永远不会被调用。在 JVM 上，这会增加可测量的延迟；而在 link:https://www.graalvm.org/[GraalVM] 本机映像中，虽然这种延迟尚在可控范围内，但仍然可以察觉。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ståle built an annotation processor: add it to your `pom.xml`, and at build time Aesh generates class files that pre-compute the command model without any reflection. Package-private or public fields eliminate reflection entirely; only private fields incur a single reflective access. The result: **125× faster** command parsing on the raw measurement, which translated to JBang's startup dropping from roughly half a second to around 200 milliseconds on the JVM, and to near-instant on native."
msgstr "Ståle 开发了一个注解处理器：将其添加到你的 `pom.xml` 中，在构建时，Aesh 会生成类文件，这些文件会在不使用任何反射的情况下预先计算命令模型。包私有或公共字段可完全消除反射；只有私有字段会引发一次反射访问。 结果：根据原始测量数据，命令解析 *速度提高了 125 倍，* 这意味着 JBang 在 JVM 上的启动时间从大约半秒缩短至约 200 毫秒，而在原生环境中则几乎瞬间完成。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "\"The JVM gets to be as fast as native, and native gets to be like super super fast,\" was Holly's one-line summary."
msgstr "“JVM的速度可以达到原生代码的水平，而原生代码的速度则会变得超级超级快，”霍莉用一句话总结道。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The companion improvement is lazy runtime loading: prior to 3.18, all subcommands were eagerly instantiated at startup even if only one would execute. In CLI (runtime) mode, Aesh now constructs subcommands only on the path that executes — so a JBang-scale CLI with dozens of subcommands no longer pays to initialize Hibernate or CDI beans that belong to commands the user never called."
msgstr "与此相关的改进是懒加载机制：在 3.18 版本之前，所有子命令都会在启动时立即实例化，即使最终只执行其中一个。 在 CLI（运行时）模式下，Aesh 现在仅在实际执行的路径上构建子命令——因此，对于拥有数十个子命令的 JBang 级 CLI 而言，不再需要为用户从未调用的命令所对应的 Hibernate 或 CDI Bean 进行初始化。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aesh on Quarkus: CDI, Invocation Context, and Testing"
msgstr "Aesh 谈 Quarkus：CDI、调用上下文与测试"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "On Quarkus, the Aesh extension adds CDI support directly to command classes. Injection works as expected — commands are beans, and all the usual Quarkus CDI patterns apply."
msgstr "在 Quarkus 中，Aesh 扩展直接为命令类添加了 CDI 支持。注入功能如预期般运行——命令被视为 Bean，且所有常规的 Quarkus CDI 模式均适用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "More interesting is the invocation context: a CDI-backed object that persists across command invocations inside a REPL session, allowing state to accumulate as the user types successive commands. This is the mechanism that makes a Quarkus-hosted REPL feel like a real application rather than a stateless CLI wrapper."
msgstr "更有趣的是其调用上下文：这是一个由 CDI 支持的对象，它能在 REPL 会话内跨命令调用而持久存在，从而允许状态随着用户连续输入命令而累积。正是这一机制，使得由 Quarkus 托管的 REPL 感觉像是一个真正的应用程序，而非一个无状态的 CLI 封装。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "For testing, the `AeshLauncher` provides a clean API: `launcher.execute(...)` runs a command and asserts the exit code; piped commands can be expressed as a chain with per-stage output assertions. It integrates with Quarkus Test, so the full CDI and service infrastructure is available in tests without special configuration."
msgstr "在测试方面 `，AeshLauncher` 提供了一个简洁的 API： `launcher.execute(…​)` 可执行一条命令并验证其退出代码；管道命令可以表示为一个包含各阶段输出验证的命令链。它与 Quarkus Test 集成，因此无需特殊配置，测试中即可使用完整的 CDI 和服务基础设施。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Demo: JVM and Native, WebSocket Terminal, TamboUI Dashboard"
msgstr "演示：JVM 与原生环境、WebSocket 终端、TamboUI 仪表盘"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ståle's live demo covered three aspects:"
msgstr "斯塔勒的现场演示涵盖了三个方面："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**CLI mode startup** — a small Quarkus Aesh app compiled to native started in **17 milliseconds**. The same app on the JVM started in approximately 500 milliseconds (with WebSocket support active; without it, faster still). Help output, CDI injection, and subcommand dispatch all worked identically in both modes."
msgstr "*CLI 模式启动* ——一个编译为原生程序的小型 Quarkus Aesh 应用在 *17 毫秒内* 启动完成。同一应用在 JVM 上启动则耗时约 500 毫秒（启用 WebSocket 支持时；若未启用，启动速度更快）。 帮助信息输出、CDI 注入和子命令分发在两种模式下均表现一致。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**WebSocket terminal** — the same application exposed its REPL over WebSocket and rendered it in a browser using https://xtermjs.org/[Xterm.js]. Multiple browser tabs became independent terminal sessions against the same running Quarkus application. Max's commentary: treat each WebSocket connection the same way you would treat any other REST request, with the same concurrency, virtual threads, and CDI session scope that Quarkus provides. Security caveat noted: \"Make sure you put a password on it.\""
msgstr "*WebSocket 终端* ——同一款应用程序通过 WebSocket 暴露了其 REPL，并使用 link:https://xtermjs.org/[Xterm.js] 在浏览器中渲染出来。 多个浏览器标签页成为了针对同一运行中 Quarkus 应用程序的独立终端会话。Max 的评论：将每个 WebSocket 连接视为普通的 REST 请求，采用 Quarkus 提供的相同并发机制、虚拟线程和 CDI 会话作用域。需注意的安全事项：“务必为其设置密码。”"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**TamboUI dashboard** — a simple TUI panel rendered inside the same application via the `ash-tui` module, which uses Aesh as its backend. The integration requires no additional wiring on Quarkus; because the module depends on Aesh and Aesh is already the default, adding the TamboUI module is enough."
msgstr "*TamboUI 仪表盘——一个* 通过 `ash-tui` 模块在同一应用程序内部渲染的简单 TUI 面板，该模块使用 Aesh 作为后端。该集成无需在 Quarkus 上进行额外配置；由于该模块依赖于 Aesh，而 Aesh 已是默认后端，因此只需添加 TamboUI 模块即可。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "TamboUI: Swing for the Command Line — But Fast"
msgstr "TamboUI：专为命令行设计的Swing界面——但运行迅速"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Max's second demo covered TamboUI directly. The pitch: Go has https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea[Bubble Tea], Rust has https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui[Ratatui] (which inspired much of TamboUI's design), Python has https://textual.textualize.io/[Textual]. Java had nothing comparable — so Max built it."
msgstr "马克斯的第二个演示直接介绍了TamboUI。他的宣传语是：Go语言有 link:https://github.com/charmbracelet/bubbletea[Bubble Tea] ，Rust语言 link:https://github.com/ratatui/ratatui[有Ratatui] （TamboUI的设计很大程度上受其启发），Python语言有 link:https://textual.textualize.io/[Textual] 。而Java语言却没有类似的工具——于是马克斯便亲手打造了它。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The design pillars:"
msgstr "设计支柱："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Reactive layout** — a flexbox model inspired by Android and web CSS. TamboUI computes layouts dynamically; resizing the terminal window causes the layout to reflow. Because a terminal coordinate space is small (measured in character cells rather than pixels), layout calculations are extremely fast."
msgstr "*响应式布局——* 一种受 Android 和 Web CSS 启发的 Flexbox 模型。TamboUI 会动态计算布局；当终端窗口调整大小时，布局会自动重排。由于终端坐标系较小（以字符单元而非像素为单位），布局计算速度极快。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**CSS styling** — components are styled with CSS-like declarations. The live demo showed an editor where changing `height: 50` to `height: 3` on a progress bar component took effect immediately, and adding `text-style: italic` to a number-rendering token turned numbers red and italic in real time. The demo editor itself used Aesh-backed syntax highlighting."
msgstr "*CSS 样式设置* ——组件通过类似 CSS 的声明进行样式设置。 实时演示展示了一个编辑器：在进度条组件中，将 ` `height: 50` ` 改为 ``height: 3` ` 后，效果立竿见影；而在数字渲染标记中添加 ``text-style: italic`` 后，数字会实时变为红色并呈现斜体效果。该演示编辑器本身采用了基于 Aesh 的语法高亮功能。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Unicode and image rendering** — TamboUI supports full Unicode and inline image rendering using modern terminal protocols (Kitty graphics, Sixel). The demo showed a file manager with source code syntax highlighting and image previews."
msgstr "*Unicode 和图像渲染* — TamboUI 支持通过现代终端协议（Kitty 图形、Sixel）实现完整的 Unicode 和内联图像渲染。演示中展示了一个支持源代码语法高亮和图像预览的文件管理器。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Pilot** — TamboUI's test harness, analogous to https://playwright.dev/[Playwright] for web UIs. Ståle flagged it as the natural counterpart to the Aesh launcher for TUI testing."
msgstr "*Pilot* —— TamboUI 的测试框架，类似于 Web UI 领域的 link:https://playwright.dev/[Playwright] 。Ståle 将其视为 Aesh 启动器在 TUI 测试领域的天然对应方案。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Performance** — the stress demo generated **350 frames per second** with every pixel changing on every frame. Max added a light-sensitivity warning after the fact."
msgstr "*性能——* 该压力测试演示在每帧所有像素均发生变化的情况下，达到了 *每秒350帧* 。Max事后添加了一条光敏警告。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Max noted that AI agents helped significantly in building TamboUI. Terminal UI patterns are decades old and extensively documented; LLMs reason about them well. The first version of the file manager was generated in a single Claude prompt, using documented terminal escape sequences and ASCII concepts that agents have clearly absorbed from decades of documentation."
msgstr "Max 指出，AI 代理在构建 TamboUI 方面发挥了重要作用。终端 UI 设计模式已有数十年历史，且相关文档极为丰富；大型语言模型（LLMs）能很好地理解这些模式。文件管理器的第一个版本仅通过一条 Claude 提示语便生成而成，其中运用了已记录的终端转义序列和 ASCII 概念——这些知识显然是代理从数十年的文档中吸收而来的。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "CLI as Agent Interface"
msgstr "CLI 作为代理接口"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The thread running through the second half of the episode is the fit between CLIs and AI agents. Max and Ståle returned to it several times:"
msgstr "本集后半部分的主线是命令行界面（CLI）与人工智能代理之间的契合度。马克斯和斯塔勒多次提及这一点："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**MCP vs. CLI** — REST endpoints and MCP tools require careful modeling. A CLI built with Ash can expose higher-level, purpose-built operations that incorporate business logic not easily expressed as item-potent REST calls. Agents can call `help` and receive a complete, readable description of every command."
msgstr "*MCP 与 CLI ——* REST 端点和 MCP 工具都需要经过仔细的建模。使用 Ash 构建的 CLI 可以提供更高层次、专为特定目的设计的操作，这些操作融入了难以通过“项强”REST 调用轻松表达的业务逻辑。代理可以调用 `帮助功能` ，并获得每个命令的完整且易于理解的描述。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Token efficiency** — text-in, text-out is the cheapest interaction model for an agent. A well-designed CLI tool consumes far fewer tokens than a browser automation or GUI-scraping approach."
msgstr "*令牌效率* ——文本输入、文本输出是代理最经济的交互模式。设计良好的命令行界面（CLI）工具消耗的令牌远少于浏览器自动化或图形用户界面（GUI）抓取方法。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Structured skill generation** — Aesh has a built-in capability to print all registered commands and their descriptions in a format that can be used to generate MCP skills or agent tool definitions automatically."
msgstr "*结构化技能生成* — Aesh 具备内置功能，可将所有已注册的命令及其描述以特定格式输出，该格式可用于自动生成 MCP 技能或代理工具定义。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Ståle's performance team at IBM is already using this pattern. Their new change-detection service for performance regression testing (a system called https://github.com/Hyperfoil/Horreum[Horreum]) grew a CLI layer used by developers to inject test data, trigger analysis, and query results — all while running the same Quarkus service that handles the REST API. CLI and REST share the same service layer, so correctness guarantees on one path cover both."
msgstr "IBM 的 Ståle 领导的性能团队已经在使用这种模式。他们用于性能回归测试的新变更检测服务（一个名为 link:https://github.com/Hyperfoil/Horreum[Horreum] 的系统）新增了一层 CLI 层，供开发人员注入测试数据、触发分析以及查询结果——而这一切都是在运行同一 Quarkus 服务的同时完成的，该服务还负责处理 REST API。 CLI 和 REST 共享同一服务层，因此对其中一条路径的正确性保证同时适用于两者。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Security and Multi-User CLI"
msgstr "安全性与多用户命令行界面"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Security for WebSocket-exposed terminals was the one area Max flagged as incomplete. Commands are CDI beans, so standard Quarkus role-based security applies once commands are annotated. SSH connections supported by Aesh-readline enforce key-based authentication. But a first-class story for per-command authorization annotations, equivalent to `@RolesAllowed` on JAX-RS endpoints, is still on the roadmap. For now the advice is to implement access control at the service layer that commands call — which works, and ensures that CLI and REST paths enforce the same policy."
msgstr "Max 指出，WebSocket 暴露终端的安全性是唯一尚未完善的地方。由于命令是 CDI Bean，因此一旦为命令添加注解，标准 Quarkus 基于角色的安全机制就会生效。Aesh-readline 支持的 SSH 连接强制执行基于密钥的身份验证。 但关于按命令授权注解（相当于 JAX-RS 端点上的 `@RolesAllowed` ）的完整解决方案，目前仍处于路线图规划阶段。现阶段的建议是在命令所调用的服务层实现访问控制——这种方法行之有效，并能确保 CLI 和 REST 路径执行相同的策略。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Key Takeaways"
msgstr "要点总结"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**The terminal revival is AI-driven** — agents prefer text I/O, SSH reachability, and low token cost over web UIs and graphical interfaces."
msgstr "*终端的复兴是由人工智能驱动的* ——代理更倾向于文本输入输出、SSH可达性以及低令牌成本，而非网页用户界面和图形界面。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Aesh 3.18's annotation processor eliminates reflection** — JBang startup dropped from ~500 ms to ~200 ms on the JVM and to 17 ms native; Quarkus handles registration automatically on the build side."
msgstr "*Aesh 3.18 的注解处理器消除了反射* ——在 JVM 上，JBang 的启动时间从约 500 毫秒缩短至约 200 毫秒，而在原生环境中则缩短至 17 毫秒；Quarkus 会在构建阶段自动处理注册。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Lazy subcommand loading** — in CLI mode, Aesh only instantiates the subcommand being executed, not the full command tree, reducing startup further for large CLIs."
msgstr "*子命令延迟加载* ——在 CLI 模式下，Aesh 仅会实例化正在执行的子命令，而不会实例化完整的命令树，从而进一步缩短了大型 CLI 的启动时间。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**REPL and CLI from one code model** — define commands once; Aesh runs them as a one-shot CLI or an interactive session depending on whether arguments are provided."
msgstr "*基于同一代码模型实现 REPL 和 CLI* —— 只需定义一次命令；Aesh 会根据是否提供了参数，将其作为一次性 CLI 或交互式会话来运行。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**CDI and invocation context** — Quarkus commands are full CDI beans; state can be preserved across REPL commands via the invocation context object."
msgstr "*CDI 与调用上下文* — Quarkus 命令是完整的 CDI Bean；通过调用上下文对象，可以在 REPL 命令之间保留状态。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**WebSocket terminal = multi-user CLI** — Aesh connections are an abstraction over local stdio, SSH, or WebSocket; Quarkus provides the concurrency and virtual threads to serve multiple sessions."
msgstr "*WebSocket 终端 = 多用户命令行界面（CLI）* —— Aesh 连接是对本地 stdio、SSH 或 WebSocket 的抽象；Quarkus 提供了并发机制和虚拟线程来支持多个会话。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**TamboUI brings Textual-grade TUIs to Java** — flexbox layout, CSS styling, image rendering, and a 350 fps rendering benchmark, all backed by Aesh and runnable in Quarkus."
msgstr "*TamboUI 为 Java 带来了媲美 Textual 的 TUI 体验* —— *支持* flexbox 布局、CSS 样式、图像渲染，并实现了 350 fps 的渲染基准测试，所有这些功能均由 Aesh 提供支持，且可在 Quarkus 中运行。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**CLI as MCP alternative** — a Quarkus app can simultaneously expose REST, WebSocket, and CLI surfaces from a single codebase, with CLI offering a more token-efficient interface for agent workflows."
msgstr "*CLI 作为 MCP 的替代方案* ——一个 Quarkus 应用可以从单一代码库同时提供 REST、WebSocket 和 CLI 接口，其中 CLI 为代理工作流提供了更节省令牌的接口。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**PicoCLI is still a great choice** — if you have a working PicoCLI app and speed is not a concern, there is no imperative to migrate. Aesh is the upgrade path when startup, completion, or REPL capabilities become requirements."
msgstr "*PicoCLI 仍然是一个不错的选择* ——如果你已有可正常运行的 PicoCLI 应用，且对速度没有特殊要求，那么就没有必要进行迁移。当需要启动、完成或 REPL 功能时，Aesh 便是升级的途径。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**Next up: Quarkus Signals** — episode 261 will cover Quarkus Signals, a new event system."
msgstr "*接下来：Quarkus Signals* ——第261期将介绍 Quarkus Signals，这是一个全新的事件系统。"

msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "解决方案"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Episode 260 makes a persuasive case that the CLI is not a legacy concern that Java developers can safely ignore. Between Aesh's annotation processor eliminating the reflection tax, TamboUI making full TUIs achievable in a few hundred lines of Java, and the Quarkus extension wiring everything to CDI and native image automatically, the Java terminal story in 2026 is better than it has been at any point since `System.in`. That it took AI agents to bring the audience back to the terminal is a historical irony Max and Ståle were clearly happy to accept."
msgstr "第 260 集有力地论证了：CLI 并非 Java 开发者可以置之不理的过时问题。 无论是Aesh的注解处理器消除了反射开销，还是TamboUI仅凭几百行Java代码就实现了完整的TUI，抑或是Quarkus扩展自动将一切与CDI和原生映像进行连接，2026年的Java终端开发现状都比 `自System.in` 以来任何时候都要好。 正是人工智能代理将受众重新带回终端，这虽是一种历史的讽刺，但 Max 和 Ståle 显然乐于接受。"

