msgid "Watch the full episode on the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/quarkusio\">Quarkus YouTube channel</a>."
msgstr "请在<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/quarkusio\">Quarkus YouTube 频道</a>上观看完整剧集。"
